{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Portal</i>'s physics-based puzzles, <i>SWAP</i> is a first-person puzzle game, offering a fresh take on the genre. Players navigate through complex puzzles using the Swap gun to switch places with monoliths, trip pressure plates, open doors, and pass through force fields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features 20 puzzles full of complex swap and physics based mechanics. A smooth difficulty progression will take you from simple problems to truly complex challenges. The mechanics are designed to be intuitive, so there's no tutorial pop-ups getting in the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoyed Portal's challenges, and mechanics, <i>SWAP</i> offers a similar experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3786950?t=1761894021","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3786950?t=1761894021","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786950/145f2d33f69dfbf310921cba8d959d698a7e052b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761894021","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786950/145f2d33f69dfbf310921cba8d959d698a7e052b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761894021","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Portal</i>'s physics-based puzzles, <i>SWAP</i> is a first-person puzzle game, offering a fresh take on the genre. Players navigate through complex puzzles using the Swap gun to switch places with monoliths, trip pressure plates, open doors, and pass through force fields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features 20 puzzles full of complex 